<title>USA: FSA says has capacity for New York City GO bonds.</title>
<headline>FSA says has capacity for New York City GO bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said Monday it has secondary market insurance capacity for New York City general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>Capacity is initially limited to $10 million per firm on a first-come, first-served basis for maturities 2007 and longer, FSA said.</p>
<p>For more information, call 212-826-0601.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
